Package: meercata
Version: @DEBIAN_VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Meercata Maintainers <meercata-maintainers@users.noreply.github.com>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11), sudo, systemd, logrotate, nftables, suricata (>= 8.0), suricata-update (>= 1.3.8)
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Description: transactional CLI-only control plane for Suricata
 Meercata provides health, rule qualification, transaction, rollback,
 and narrowly scoped privileged-operation foundations for Suricata.
 This development package remains gated from live production promotion.
